<title>USA: Salomon mortgage unit files $3 bln shelf.</title>
<headline>Salomon mortgage unit files $3 bln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Mortgage Securities VII Inc filed a registration statement Friday with regulators to offer up to $3 billion in senior mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the Salomon unit said the securities to be issued include six classes of senior certificates and three classes of subordinate certificates.</p>
</text>
